# Production overrides.
#
# Intentionally empty of backend URLs. A production build reaches every backend
# through the rewrites in vercel.json, which is also where a deployment URL
# changes — setting a VITE_*_API_URL here (or in the Vercel dashboard) would
# bypass the rewrite and make the request cross-origin, which breaks the auth
# cookie.
#
# Shared build-time values live in .env and apply here too.
